set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9FullMeasureSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9FullMeasureSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}full\\text{-}measure\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9FullMeasureSet}_S(A,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land A\\in\\Sigma\\land\\mu(X\\setminus A)=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}full\\text{-}measure\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9FullMeasureSet}_S(A,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land A\\in\\Sigma\\land\\mu(X\\setminus A)=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sigma algebra is an explicit parameter instead of being reconstructed from an unspecified measure graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"